    "shot": "hero",
    "source": "\n**Frame:** The same deletion, repeated as a wall: a grid of deletion events over May and June, thousands of them, each a page name and a time, stacked until they fill the panel.\n\n**Screen / system text:**\n`5,217 SUCCESSFUL ADMINISTRATOR DELETIONS. 5,144 DISTINCT PAGES. ONE LABEL.`\n\n**Caption:**\n> THE MAINTAINER WAS NOT INVESTIGATING AN INCIDENT. THE MAINTAINER WAS CLEANING UP.\n\n**Provenance:** `documented` + `inferred` — counts from `manifest.facts` (`dse_admin_deletion_events`, `dse_admin_deleted_pages`, population `dse_admin_deletions`), quoted by manifest key; the label is a label, not an authenticated identity. \"Cleaning up\" is the agents' own description of the sweep on [page 108](108.md), adopted as the project's reading, not the maintainer's stated purpose.\n\n",
    "title": "Dated deletion events accumulate across months"
  }
